usage: smp_option_stress.py [-h] --out-dir OUT_DIR [--iterations ITERATIONS]
                            [--seed SEED] [--timeout TIMEOUT]
                            [--sanitizer {none,tsan}]
                            engine

A1: 250 Threads=2 go/stop cycles plus six live option stop/join probes. Reuses
Forge's UCI deadlines, SMP legal-move/ponder checks and raw-stream driver. No
match or performance claim. Engine execution is explicit; --help runs none.
IDEA_SOURCE: user A1 TSan contract and this repository's existing UCI/SMP
tests.

positional arguments:
  engine

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --out-dir OUT_DIR     new evidence directory
  --iterations ITERATIONS
  --seed SEED           workload scheduling seed, not a gate seed
  --timeout TIMEOUT     deadline per UCI response
  --sanitizer {none,tsan}
